Now let me think about the "Sorry, you are not allowed to access this page" error. This appears when a WordPress admin page check fails for capabilities. 

Wait - could this be related to the smoke test? Let me look at it again. The smoke.spec.ts has:

```typescript
test.beforeAll( () => {
    wpCli( "eval \"delete_site_option( 'backwpup_onboarding' );\"" );
